WEBVTT

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:19.490
...and Aliki through the mirror.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.380
Oh

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:10.370
"You can't get out, Cinder. But neither can I. We're in prison. I don't know what we're going to do if we stay in there any longer."

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:30.000
"I know you're smart, Cinder, but you can't play hide-and-seek. I found it. Let's pretend we're in Egypt, and I..."

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:41.530
I'm Vasilisa, it's nice and warm in Egypt, I'll order my men to build the biggest pyramid in the world, that's what we played yesterday

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:42.480
Aliki?

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:43.560
Hello, dad

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.640
I have to go for a job

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:46.580
Is it a job?

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:52.700
A lot, a little boy in Clinton's house is eager to come to the world and I have to help him

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.700
You'll wear my coat and my boots

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:58.970
No, Stas, I can't take you with me this time

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:00.000
But there's a terrible storm

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:04.980
I know. That's why I won't take you. George Hanson will come with me.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:08.280
The road is not safe. We might get stuck.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:10.250
I'll blow the snow!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.460
You know you're my dear friend.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.760
But this time you'll stay here, where it's nice and warm.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:19.790
I'll be back soon for a game of chess. Okay?

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:23.570
Okay... I hope a girl will be born!

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:28.900
And I hope you're wrong. I promised boys.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:45.160
I have to think of a very good move to beat Dad tonight.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:49.140
Here it is. This one will make it difficult.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:55.880
Cinder, you won.

00:03:57.410 --> 00:04:00.000
Now that I've won the White Kingdom...

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.950
I wish I was a queen like you!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:08.960
If I was a queen, I would take my horse to my kingdom

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.960
and I would make it all beautiful!

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:17.850
I would order the storms to stop

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.840
and have summer every day!

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:30.000
I would order the vegetable to grow and the flowers to bloom!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:36.740
I will make the sun shine all day and every night there will be a beautiful sunset.

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:41.170
It's like the mirror shows another place.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.170
How beautiful it is!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:47.100
I wish I could go to the other side of the mirror.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:48.100
What's happening?

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.100
The mirror is turning red.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:56.870
It's like the sun is shining on the other side of the mirror.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:57.870
It's like the sun is shining on the other side of the mirror.

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:58.710
It's like the sun is shining on the other side of the mirror.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:04:59.970
It's like the sun is shining on the other side of the mirror.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.070
It's getting soft! My finger is moving inside!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:06.980
What's going on?

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:36.320
On the other side of the mirror!

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:38.320
Is this really happening to me?

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:48.040
What should I say now?

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:53.860
I don't even know what to think!

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.860
I feel a beautiful surprise!

00:05:55.860 --> 00:06:00.000
Everything changed quickly here!

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:04.670
It's not a dream, it's real!

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:07.400
It's unbelievable, crazy!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:11.410
I'm inside the mirror!

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.790
It looks magical!

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:17.940
I like it!

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:22.820
It's wonderful, fantastic!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.210
Oh, look!

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:26.830
I don't know what else to say!

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.980
What a colorful country this is!

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.990
In the morning it didn't exist on Earth!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:38.970
This isn't a dream, it's alive, it's real!

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:41.650
But it's unbelievable, it's crazy!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:49.230
I got inside the mirror, it looks magical!

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:53.110
It's happening, it's true!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:07.180
So, yeah, there must be people in this beautiful country.

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:18.560
You're a bird!

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:20.720
You're a bird?

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:23.400
That's how birds are in this country?

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:29.700
Are you some kind of animal?

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.010
What are you saying? I'm a magician!

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.120
Are you serious? Who are you?

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.610
I'm Tom Fool.

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:51.720
I'm the commander of the court and the great magician of the white kingdom of the first quadrangle.

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:56.540
The white kingdom of the first quadrangle sounds like a game of chess!

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:59.930
Of course! You're in the land of chess!

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:03.760
I always play hide-and-seek with my dad.

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:09.280
Then you understand why we were watching you this way.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:14.360
We don't want anyone to come from the side of the Red King to our square.

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:18.200
But I'm not one of them. I'm Yaliki.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.200
And I come from the other side of the mirror.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:25.360
Look at that! We don't often have tourists.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:30.000
Do you mean that other people also come here through the mirror a few times?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.910
No. Honestly, you're the first.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:40.230
Oh, that's wonderful. Can you call me again, please?

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:48.050
Hey, stop it. I'm a entertainer, a magician, an illiterate, not a tourist.

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:50.250
Fine, then tell me what to see.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.450
I'm sorry, but I'm saying to disappear again.

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:59.060
Don't leave. You're the first one I see and I don't know where to go.

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:06.060
Ok, come on. I will take you to the top of the hill and from there you will see the whole country.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.480
Thank you.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:24.560
What's happening?

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:28.030
I can't reach you.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.000
You have to run faster.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:34.280
I can run as fast as I can, but I can't reach anywhere.

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:39.180
In this country, if you can run as fast as you can, you stay in the same place.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.180
You have to run much faster!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.380
That's impossible!

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:49.680
♪ To run fast is not very difficult ♪

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:53.200
♪ It's enough to go slow first and then the opposite ♪

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:57.210
♪ But if you think you can't, the problem is in your head ♪

00:09:57.210 --> 00:10:00.000
♪ Say "I'll change it" and you'll change the last one ♪

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:06.270
And I forgot the impossible

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:10.340
To almost forget the impossible

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.680
And don't think it's easy

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:15.340
I know a lot to tell you

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:19.670
You can do the impossible

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:26.150
The impossible can change you

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:28.520
To the north if you want to go around

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.000
And run to the south

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.560
If you want to turn back, go far away

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:37.320
If you want to go high, you have to stay low

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:41.290
Do the mistakes to learn the right things

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:46.120
And forget the impossible

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:50.200
To almost forget the impossible

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.440
And don't think it's simple

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:55.250
I know a lot to tell you

00:10:55.250 --> 00:11:00.000
You can do the impossible

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.390
♪ But you are... ♪

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.200
♪ strong! ♪

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:07.170
Nothing is impossible.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:09.140
It may never happen,

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.960
but whatever you think, it is possible.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.960
I think I'm at the top of the hill.

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:16.050
But I'm not.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:24.080
Think carefully.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:26.090
Yes, you did it!

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:29.520
Oh, it was wonderful!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.000
You can see all of our land!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.000
It's exactly like Douskaki!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.830
Exactly! And you are in the white square!

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.750
You always start from the white square, you know!

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:44.620
But where are the queens, the queens, the pawns, the castles and the pawns?

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:45.600
Down there!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.500
Oh, I would really like to see them!

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.530
I don't care if I become a pawn!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:52.590
It's easy! You are a pawn!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:55.740
But I would prefer to be a queen!

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:57.740
I always wanted to be a queen!

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.880
This is difficult.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:04.070
You have to cross the whole country until square eight alpha

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.010
To become queen

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:07.380
How can I do that?

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:10.380
First, you have to get the permission of the White Queen

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:12.380
I'll ask her right away

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:15.890
But she doesn't accept people

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:17.890
You work for the White Queen

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:21.730
If it's not work, I entertain her, that's all

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:24.730
You can't take me with you when you go to see her

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:27.840
Yes, why not?

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:30.000
If she remembers, I'll tell her how to do it

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:36.500
You're a monster and I caught you! Let's go!

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:40.400
The castle of the White Queen looks like Aethu's nest!

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:44.250
The Queen has nails like Aethu's. And she grunts, too.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:47.250
Oh, that sounds scary!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:57.690
She snores more than she grunts. Let's go!

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:00.000
Can we get in, My Lord?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:04.000
Tomfool! Where have you been? I've been calling you for an hour!

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:07.950
I was wandering in your area, old lady. I was looking for scouts.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:12.840
If you've caught anyone, bring him here so we can have a little fun.

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:17.680
It's so boring in here, in this golden mausoleum.

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:22.560
Boring? Do you want to have fun, miss?

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.710
I would like to hear some joke.

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:30.000
I don't laugh much sitting here with this old fool.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:37.110
And from there, he got hurt!

00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:42.970
If he stayed there like that for long, they would have put him to bed!

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:45.140
Now, put me down, Tom!

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:52.600
The beds don't put me down!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:03.150
Not even the fast fingers, of course!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.000
It's not in fashion.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:08.000
Do something funny, something that will make me go crazy.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:19.950
Today, we have very big stars with us, who will entertain you unimaginably.

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:27.270
Women have another beauty.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:37.640
"Hey, what would you like me to eat with you, some sweet pizza, how do you like it?"

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:52.770
"Stop with the nonsense, do some magic trick, something super-ghostly!"

00:14:52.770 --> 00:15:00.000
"Azuuu, book and quadruple!"

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:04.520
Golly-wog, hoof-and-toof, oi-gwabooos!

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:12.930
You are like an artist!

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.930
See how you did this trick?

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:17.010
You took the monster out of your sleeve!

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:18.560
Now make him leave!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.070
Go away, go away!

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:39.860
That's good, I knew that the wizard had humans in his crown, but not pawns.

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:42.920
I see, however, that you are two.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:46.300
Who is the other boy that you would like to meet today, Tom?

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:52.310
Ask him right away.

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:55.810
My name is Aliki, my lord.

00:15:55.810 --> 00:15:58.260
I am not a boy, I am a girl.

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:00.000
Impossible, since you are wearing

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:00.980
Do you have pants?

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.170
We wear them too.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.170
What are you talking about? I don't care what you say.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.120
They are pants.

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:09.170
And boys wear pants.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:12.440
Many girls wear pants today, miss.

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:13.440
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:17.440
When I was your age, I wore beautiful clothes.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:21.440
And I gave my hair to a beautiful girl with a big skirt.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:24.440
You would have been a very beautiful little girl, huh?

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:27.490
Aha! You are very smart.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:30.000
And you have a double chin.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.950
You are useful to us, maybe we can make you our new president.

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:36.870
What do you say, Flash?

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:41.180
Answer, you idiot!

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:46.180
Yes, yes. Well, President, I feel...

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:49.180
Bravo! I'm glad you feel it.

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:54.180
For a moment I thought you weren't breathing.

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:58.140
The little one is right, Xurafi. I say we make her our new prime minister.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:00.000
How do you feel, Xypnos?

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:03.970
If you really want my advice...

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.970
Don't bother!

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:08.960
Just move your head that you agree!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:15.340
You found yourself again, as I see!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:20.980
It's done!

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:22.970
Get up here, little one!

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:25.970
And I will appoint you as Prime Minister!

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:28.970
But I don't want to become Prime Minister, My Lord!

00:17:28.970 --> 00:17:29.830
But I don't want to become Prime Minister!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.650
I want to become a Queen!

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:35.600
You're not as smart as I thought you were.

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:38.480
You know what you need to become a Queen?

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:39.340
Tom told me.

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:43.290
I have to get from square one to square eight.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.180
With your permission.

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:47.000
It's not easy.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:52.000
The Red Queen and the King will try to stop you from getting there with their satanic tricks.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.120
I'll make it!

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:56.120
You'll meet some crazy people.

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:58.130
Not normal and well-known people like us.

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:00.000
Ha ha ha!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:05.220
And a weird guy in square five, they call him Humpty Dumpty, nonsense, crazy!

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:07.890
I know everything about Humpty Dumpty!

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:11.630
Here! Wait for you to reach square six and seven!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:16.630
Have you heard about dragons, monsters, vultures, spiders and other monsters?

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.210
I've never seen them!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:20.510
Well then, you'll see a lot!

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:25.100
Be very careful of the Jabberwock, he's... terrifying!

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:30.000
Ah, but if you manage to get to the square of your Red Kingdom,

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.000
"She'll come, she'll come! Ha ha ha! She'll just come!"

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.000
"So you're giving me your permission?"

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.000
"Yes, yes, little one, go!"

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:42.860
"Tom Foole will take you to square two and he'll show you the way!"

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:48.000
"When you become queen, you'll come again and we'll drink together to your health!"

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.000
"Go now!"

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.160
"Thank you, Your Majesty!"

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:30.000
The base of this pharaon is the entrance to the quadrangle 2 and the beginning of your journey to be born again.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:35.920
- I can't wait to start. - The first part of the journey is very easy.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:40.770
- The closer you get to the eighth, the harder it gets. - I'll make it.

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:45.170
- Let's assume you make it, Queen. You know how to dress like a queen.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:50.330
- I think so. - You are and you dress like a little girl.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:55.190
But to become a queen, you have to dress like you are from a noble family.

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:57.680
- I'll try my best.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:03.800
I'll give you some advice.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:09.190
Listen.

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:14.710
♪ Abandonment, from your throne ♪

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:17.750
♪ To climb high ♪

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.290
♪ It would be better ♪

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:22.980
♪ To win it, if you think about it ♪

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:27.840
♪ With your scepter, for respect ♪

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:30.000
♪ Always tough ♪

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:33.550
It would be so unthinkable

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:34.950
That's how I feel

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:37.860
What about you?

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:40.340
Eugenia

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:43.830
That's the one you should conquer

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:46.070
Eugenia

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:50.300
It's better to win her over

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:54.480
Everyone will praise you

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:57.240
And you'll never make a mistake

00:20:57.240 --> 00:21:00.000
What you say is impossible

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:05.140
Do you know how to do it?

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:10.660
Be polite, that's the way to win

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:17.110
Be polite, it's better to win

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:19.010
So Eliki, I'll tell you how to do it

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:21.190
To be like an ice-cold one

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:23.190
I prefer to be good

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:24.010
Always disagreeing

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.010
No one can do it

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:27.020
To be mean to the people

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:28.020
It's not polite

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:30.000
To be wise, and what are you?

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:31.120
I want to play!

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.440
You're stupid and tough!

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:33.920
I want to be quiet and polite!

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:35.440
You're a fool and a bitch!

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:36.440
I don't do that!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.160
Don't shout! Don't make noises!

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:39.200
You do it if you want!

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:40.440
I wasn't born for that!

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.120
I don't care about the bad things!

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:49.320
A country to rule it needs more!

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:52.320
Cooperation is more important!

00:21:52.320 --> 00:21:55.320
That's what I'm telling you!

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.570
Kindness!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:03.000
This one, to conquer...

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.210
Eugenia!

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:08.360
Better, to conquer her!

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:13.500
You think I won't become queen?

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:18.390
Look, if you succeed, I would like to become your slave and your wizard.

00:22:18.390 --> 00:22:20.430
Really? Thank you, Tom!

00:22:20.430 --> 00:22:24.520
And now, I will take you to the second square.

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:27.340
How do we get to the base of the Great Barrier?

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:30.000
We will climb to the top of the sky.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:33.680
- But it's not raining! - It will rain.

00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:38.360
- I don't believe it! The sky is crystal clear!

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:44.630
- It's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining!

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:47.630
- It's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining, it's raining!

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:59.890
- Now you believe it? - I believe it! Stop it!

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:04.120
Fire! Go away! Another day will come!

00:23:07.170 --> 00:23:12.260
I've said this many times, but the rain never leaves.

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:21.060
Here's the sky, Toxo!

00:23:31.880 --> 00:23:34.440
You'll do everything so easily, Tom.

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:38.580
It won't be easy. After square two, you'll be alone.

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:40.580
I have to serve the White Queen.

00:23:40.580 --> 00:23:42.680
You said you'd serve me.

00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:44.690
You're not a queen yet.

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:48.210
By the time I reach number six, I'll be almost a queen.

00:23:48.370 --> 00:23:49.810
Will you come and find me there?

00:23:49.810 --> 00:23:50.930
I'll try.

00:23:51.210 --> 00:23:51.850
Let's go.

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:53.840
Where to?

00:23:53.920 --> 00:23:55.560
To where the board shows.

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:57.270
But what does it say?

00:23:57.680 --> 00:23:59.130
I can't read it.

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:00.000
It says...

00:24:00.190 --> 00:24:01.730
to the second square.

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:03.080
It's upside down.

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:06.390
Don't forget, you're on the other side of the mirror,

00:24:06.550 --> 00:24:08.550
and everything is upside down here.

00:24:09.860 --> 00:24:12.980
When you look at the mirror, my left hand, in fact,

00:24:13.060 --> 00:24:15.440
is the right side of the picture through the mirror.

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:21.040
So, we have to go the other way from where the sign shows.

00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:24.620
It's very complicated.

00:24:25.260 --> 00:24:27.600
I don't know if I can do it without you.

00:24:27.890 --> 00:24:30.000
Of course! You ruled all the time.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:34.000
You are almost a queen, that's why you can do anything.

00:24:34.000 --> 00:24:35.340
Almost.

00:24:37.570 --> 00:24:51.600
Now you are in the second square and you can start your journey.

00:24:51.600 --> 00:24:56.080
Oh! The more I go, the more beautiful the country becomes!

00:24:56.080 --> 00:25:00.000
Hurry up! You still have six squares to go!

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:01.850
How will you get through all of this?

00:25:01.850 --> 00:25:06.770
In the first movement, two quadrants are going. I will lead you to that.

00:25:06.770 --> 00:25:10.660
Then you will take the train from the third quadrant very quickly.

00:25:10.660 --> 00:25:13.570
I like trains.

00:25:13.570 --> 00:25:25.990
Oh, what noise is that? It looks like thousands of giant melisses are living.

00:25:25.990 --> 00:25:29.890
Very right. It is the abode of melisses.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:32.020
And in this drama, more. Amen.

00:26:03.870 --> 00:26:06.510
You're so charming!

00:26:15.170 --> 00:26:19.520
But they're elephants! They told me! I-I've seen them!

00:26:19.520 --> 00:26:25.390
Don't believe everything you hear, and believe half of what you see!

00:26:25.390 --> 00:26:30.000
Fine. Then I believe that they're half-males and half-males.

00:26:30.250 --> 00:26:31.250
What do you think?

00:26:31.250 --> 00:26:34.740
This is a very wise royal observation.

00:26:34.740 --> 00:26:36.530
Thank you.

00:26:36.530 --> 00:26:52.290
We continue now.

00:26:52.290 --> 00:26:53.490
Let's go.

00:27:08.410 --> 00:27:10.650
I haven't seen such creatures before.

00:27:10.650 --> 00:27:11.850
Shall we hunt them down?

00:27:11.850 --> 00:27:12.970
Why not?

00:27:15.910 --> 00:27:24.830
We want two volunteers!

00:27:24.830 --> 00:27:26.490
Thank you, Thilarakos!

00:27:26.490 --> 00:27:28.300
Hey, Collite! What's up?

00:27:28.300 --> 00:27:30.000
Jammy!

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:44.490
Okay, I'll jump on it. You go with him. I'll take the only time.

00:27:44.490 --> 00:27:47.380
We'll go to square three, to P and F.

00:27:47.380 --> 00:27:55.480
Day, are you okay?

00:27:55.480 --> 00:27:57.490
Day is bad.

00:27:57.490 --> 00:27:59.730
Hey, do I look like a horse to you?

00:28:00.380 --> 00:28:01.700
Elioulaki?

00:28:01.700 --> 00:28:05.180
You can't see it! I'm a Centaur!

00:28:05.180 --> 00:28:09.860
I'm sorry. I forgot that I have to believe only half of what I see.

00:28:09.860 --> 00:28:14.300
You're a human in front and a horse in the back!

00:28:14.300 --> 00:28:16.230
Very right!

00:28:16.230 --> 00:28:19.030
Look! Tom has passed us!

00:28:19.030 --> 00:28:20.510
We can go now!

00:28:20.510 --> 00:28:21.910
Where should we go?

00:28:21.910 --> 00:28:23.980
To the third square!

00:28:23.980 --> 00:28:30.000
And why don't you say it from the beginning, my girl?

00:28:38.830 --> 00:28:41.710
This foolish monochrome threw me down!

00:28:41.870 --> 00:28:43.510
You couldn't get back up?

00:28:43.630 --> 00:28:46.550
I was so angry that I transformed into a wolf!

00:28:46.710 --> 00:28:47.870
And you put it on your feet!

00:28:48.370 --> 00:28:51.490
I have no choice but to take both of you with me.

00:28:51.640 --> 00:28:52.800
Get down, too!

00:28:53.910 --> 00:28:54.670
See you!

00:28:55.430 --> 00:28:57.270
It was nice, Socrates!

00:28:59.080 --> 00:29:00.000
Calm down!

00:29:00.480 --> 00:29:04.960
I will do my magic tricks!

00:29:04.960 --> 00:29:12.640
Now you will see!

00:29:16.110 --> 00:29:17.270
No, an airplane!

00:29:17.270 --> 00:29:19.170
It's Pegasus!

00:29:19.170 --> 00:29:29.550
I should have called for Mr. Pegasus from the beginning!

00:29:29.550 --> 00:29:30.000
Now!

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:34.840
Now we will travel first, without stopping, until square three.

00:29:34.840 --> 00:29:35.840
Let's go!

00:29:35.840 --> 00:29:57.430
One of these creatures does not leave the second square, but I found more!

00:30:02.300 --> 00:30:07.140
There's the gate to the quadrangle 3!

00:30:07.140 --> 00:30:11.800
From here on out, on your own!

00:30:11.800 --> 00:30:14.110
I wish they'd come with me, Tom...

00:30:14.110 --> 00:30:16.310
You'll be fine!

00:30:16.310 --> 00:30:21.850
Hurry up! The train that will take you through the quadrangle 3 is waiting for you at the station!

00:30:21.850 --> 00:30:24.470
- Bye-bye! - Bye-bye!

00:30:26.150 --> 00:30:30.000
- Everyone, get ready! - Wait!

00:30:30.990 --> 00:30:31.700
I'm coming!

00:30:32.900 --> 00:30:35.850
Please, stand!

00:30:47.850 --> 00:30:49.950
I'm glad I'm traveling with you.

00:30:51.070 --> 00:30:52.170
My name is Aliki.

00:30:52.930 --> 00:30:54.730
That's how you're called.

00:30:55.210 --> 00:30:56.510
But what are you?

00:30:57.120 --> 00:30:58.020
I'm a girl.

00:30:58.560 --> 00:30:59.860
How strange!

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:02.970
-I'm a girl. -Yes, I know.

00:31:02.970 --> 00:31:07.770
Really? Yes. I assume I'm well-known.

00:31:07.770 --> 00:31:11.410
I'm the president of the Silk Road.

00:31:11.410 --> 00:31:16.540
Very nice. I hope to see you again on my return train.

00:31:16.540 --> 00:31:21.600
Impossible. Our trains only go in one direction.

00:31:21.600 --> 00:31:26.550
Strange. You would take the double train to go in both directions.

00:31:26.550 --> 00:31:30.000
In both directions? What do you mean?

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:31.960
a static perception

00:31:31.960 --> 00:31:34.050
bold, bold but

00:31:34.050 --> 00:31:36.010
very annoying

00:31:36.010 --> 00:31:37.980
I have to think about it

00:31:37.980 --> 00:31:39.900
yes, yes, yes

00:31:39.900 --> 00:31:45.500
it is very challenging

00:31:45.500 --> 00:31:51.210
You didn't tell me your name

00:31:51.210 --> 00:31:53.130
Tuff Biscuit

00:31:53.130 --> 00:31:55.190
Tuff Biscuit

00:31:55.190 --> 00:31:57.300
Oh yes

00:31:57.300 --> 00:31:59.310
you are a famous athlete

00:31:59.310 --> 00:32:00.000
I have heard a lot about you

00:32:00.090 --> 00:32:01.090
Thank you very much!

00:32:01.090 --> 00:32:05.230
No, no. My nickname is Biscuit.

00:32:05.230 --> 00:32:09.170
My first name is Duff, like Charlie.

00:32:09.170 --> 00:32:11.320
Charlie Biscuit.

00:32:11.320 --> 00:32:15.370
I drive a car with milk on square four.

00:32:15.370 --> 00:32:18.330
It's a good and honorable job.

00:32:18.330 --> 00:32:20.330
I'm sure you'll do very well.

00:32:20.330 --> 00:32:25.150
Yes. I get as much yogurt as I want for free.

00:32:25.150 --> 00:32:27.620
Wonderful!

00:32:27.620 --> 00:32:29.630
Half the yogurt!

00:32:30.510 --> 00:32:34.080
Oh, and you, sir? What's your name?

00:32:34.080 --> 00:32:35.080
Post Gazette.

00:32:35.080 --> 00:32:37.540
You remind me of the newspaper.

00:32:37.540 --> 00:32:42.280
I'm the newspaper. The first in circulation all over the country.

00:32:42.280 --> 00:32:43.170
Are you reading me?

00:32:43.170 --> 00:32:48.880
No. I mean, I can't read you because you're printed backwards.

00:32:48.880 --> 00:32:51.710
How dare you! I hear backwards.

00:32:51.710 --> 00:32:55.670
Oh, just for me. And that's because I'm coming from the other side of the mirror.

00:32:55.670 --> 00:33:00.000
Oh, okay. I assume there are two sides to everything.

00:33:05.600 --> 00:33:07.600
You're very naive, young lady.

00:33:07.600 --> 00:33:10.200
Are you talking to me?

00:33:10.200 --> 00:33:12.200
Is there any other young lady in here?

00:33:12.200 --> 00:33:14.200
No, but what did I do?

00:33:14.200 --> 00:33:18.330
First, you were staring at my gorgeous dress.

00:33:18.330 --> 00:33:20.430
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:33:20.430 --> 00:33:24.340
And also, you were studying her dress with economics.

00:33:24.340 --> 00:33:26.260
I didn't understand.

00:33:26.260 --> 00:33:30.000
And in just five minutes, I noticed that you were drunk without a drink.

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:32.240
Don't be shy about my style with the comics!

00:33:32.240 --> 00:33:37.520
I'm very sorry, but I've never seen a man in a newspaper!

00:33:37.520 --> 00:33:41.050
Unbelievable! Who brings you the daily newspaper?

00:33:41.050 --> 00:33:42.860
A boy sells it.

00:33:42.860 --> 00:33:46.520
Boys grow up and become men in newspapers.

00:33:46.520 --> 00:33:50.000
After you've seen one, you'll see the other.

00:33:50.000 --> 00:33:53.140
You shouldn't be too observant.

00:33:53.140 --> 00:33:55.880
However, I apologize.

00:33:55.880 --> 00:33:59.890
Oh, this stupid train passed my station! Quick!

00:34:00.030 --> 00:34:01.670
Get me out of the window!

00:34:01.670 --> 00:34:12.830
Thank you!

00:34:12.830 --> 00:34:27.590
But we're on a train!

00:34:27.590 --> 00:34:29.280
Why are we flying?

00:34:29.280 --> 00:34:30.000
We found it!

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:34.680
We're going to the hill. How else will we get to the other side?

00:34:34.680 --> 00:34:37.380
You can dig a tunnel through the hill.

00:34:37.380 --> 00:34:44.260
You know, this is a very interesting idea. Super smart!

00:34:44.260 --> 00:34:55.450
I will suggest it to the next council.

00:34:55.450 --> 00:34:59.540
Close the window. We will pass by the river.

00:35:13.500 --> 00:35:15.500
But of course, it's on our way!

00:35:15.500 --> 00:35:18.160
Why don't you make a bridge over the river?

00:35:18.160 --> 00:35:20.160
Ehh, smart!

00:35:20.160 --> 00:35:22.080
Selfish!

00:35:22.080 --> 00:35:30.000
You would like to become a

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:32.500
You are the president of our council.

00:35:33.170 --> 00:35:36.170
Thank you. But I hope to become a queen.

00:35:36.860 --> 00:35:40.800
Why don't you go higher? To become a queen, that is.

00:35:41.300 --> 00:35:43.800
Only a man becomes a king.

00:35:44.250 --> 00:35:46.250
Will you get involved with politics?

00:35:46.660 --> 00:35:49.270
In your place, I will stay out of this.

00:35:50.650 --> 00:35:52.150
Is this the end of the quad?

00:35:52.650 --> 00:35:59.830
Get out, all of you!

00:36:00.760 --> 00:36:02.760
What about us taking the train?

00:36:02.760 --> 00:36:05.860
You have to! We're going north!

00:36:05.860 --> 00:36:08.790
And the north is always upwards, you know!

00:36:08.790 --> 00:36:11.650
It would be much easier if we went south!

00:36:11.650 --> 00:36:13.660
The south is at the top!

00:36:13.660 --> 00:36:16.660
But that happens on the map!

00:36:16.660 --> 00:36:18.660
But we're on the map!

00:36:18.660 --> 00:36:21.660
Please hurry! We're wasting our time!

00:36:21.660 --> 00:36:23.330
Let's go!

00:36:30.190 --> 00:36:32.190
Put your strength into it!

00:36:36.980 --> 00:36:40.980
It's so tiring that I'm telling myself to go on foot the rest of the way.

00:36:40.980 --> 00:36:42.980
Have a good day!

00:36:42.980 --> 00:36:47.950
You won't find any excuse to leave!

00:36:47.950 --> 00:36:50.840
I'm not very smart.

00:36:50.840 --> 00:36:55.380
That's why I drank the milk I mixed with the milk.

00:37:14.490 --> 00:37:19.950
We hope you enjoyed the journey by train.

00:37:19.950 --> 00:37:24.830
Can you tell me how far is the fourth square?

00:37:24.830 --> 00:37:28.840
It's beyond the river. The ferry boat will pass you across.

00:37:28.840 --> 00:37:29.840
There's no water.

00:37:31.440 --> 00:37:33.740
Yes, so that the ship doesn't sink.

00:37:34.390 --> 00:37:35.650
Have a nice day, kid.

00:37:36.910 --> 00:37:38.160
I'm going!

00:38:11.640 --> 00:38:14.490
To square four, as it seems.

00:38:14.490 --> 00:38:16.890
Where am I going now?

00:38:16.890 --> 00:38:19.780
A sign!

00:38:19.780 --> 00:38:21.600
This will show me!

00:38:21.600 --> 00:38:25.670
Great help!

00:38:34.540 --> 00:38:37.840
One, two, one, two, one, two, one.

00:38:37.840 --> 00:38:40.600
Did you have a good jogging today?

00:38:40.600 --> 00:38:43.470
I was going to a chaos, you told me "one, two" instead of "one, two".

00:38:43.470 --> 00:38:45.050
But it didn't happen that way.

00:38:45.050 --> 00:38:46.850
You did it many times.

00:38:46.850 --> 00:38:48.870
How would you feel if you didn't eat a bouffle?

00:38:48.870 --> 00:38:50.670
And who would give it to me?

00:38:50.670 --> 00:38:53.180
Sir, please.

00:38:53.180 --> 00:38:56.850
Hello, I'm Eliki.

00:38:56.850 --> 00:39:00.000
I'm Tutelta.

00:39:08.320 --> 00:39:10.320
We are friends! Friends, good!

00:39:10.320 --> 00:39:12.310
We do not agree, but much!

00:39:12.310 --> 00:39:14.310
Twitlydam and Twitlydy!

00:39:14.310 --> 00:39:16.310
But we are always together!

00:39:16.310 --> 00:39:20.310
Oh, how it turns out and you always end!

00:39:20.310 --> 00:39:22.310
Sorry, Twitlydy! Twitlydam!

00:39:22.310 --> 00:39:24.200
In the bag, the best!

00:39:24.200 --> 00:39:26.120
In the basket, first!

00:39:26.120 --> 00:39:28.130
No, you! Twitlydy!

00:39:28.130 --> 00:39:30.000
And Twitlydam, better!

00:39:30.220 --> 00:39:31.820
Twitlidam and Twitlidil.

00:39:31.900 --> 00:39:35.730
Come on, my friend. We've been together for a few days.

00:39:35.820 --> 00:39:40.170
So, we had to be friends.

00:39:40.250 --> 00:39:42.100
-No. -Yes.

00:39:42.260 --> 00:39:44.460
-I'm Twitlidam. -And I'm Twitlidil.

00:39:44.540 --> 00:39:46.580
-I look like him. -Me too.

00:39:46.660 --> 00:39:48.660
An incredible similarity.

00:39:48.740 --> 00:39:50.820
Twitlidam and Twitlidil.

00:39:50.900 --> 00:39:52.150
Twitlidam.

00:39:52.240 --> 00:39:54.080
-Hey, we haven't met. -Yes.

00:39:54.160 --> 00:39:56.160
Twitlidam and Twitlidil.

00:39:56.180 --> 00:39:58.870
Twitlidam and Twitlidil.

00:40:01.310 --> 00:40:03.300
I've heard a lot about you two.

00:40:03.300 --> 00:40:05.240
Not about you, though.

00:40:05.240 --> 00:40:07.240
I'm coming from the other side of the mirror.

00:40:07.240 --> 00:40:09.230
Are you a giant?

00:40:09.230 --> 00:40:12.730
No, I'm just a little girl.

00:40:12.730 --> 00:40:16.120
Then I'd like to see a big one.

00:40:16.120 --> 00:40:18.120
I'm going to become a queen.

00:40:18.120 --> 00:40:21.120
Tell me how to get to the next square, please.

00:40:21.120 --> 00:40:23.970
Follow the signs. That's why they exist.

00:40:23.970 --> 00:40:26.470
But they show different directions.

00:40:26.470 --> 00:40:30.000
The signs are for people like you who come from the other side of the mirror.

00:40:30.060 --> 00:40:33.110
You have to go in the opposite direction from where the signs are.

00:40:33.110 --> 00:40:35.350
What signs?

00:40:35.350 --> 00:40:39.280
Both. If you want to go to the left, you have to go to the right.

00:40:39.280 --> 00:40:41.280
And if you want to go to the right, you have to go to the left.

00:40:41.280 --> 00:40:42.280
Right?

00:40:42.280 --> 00:40:43.280
No, to the left.

00:40:43.280 --> 00:40:45.140
To the left, I said.

00:40:45.140 --> 00:40:47.150
You said to the right.

00:40:47.150 --> 00:40:49.150
I'll kick you to the right.

00:40:49.150 --> 00:40:50.150
Come on, try.

00:40:50.150 --> 00:40:55.020
Please, don't panic. I'll find the way on my own. Thank you.

00:40:55.020 --> 00:40:56.910
We're glad we helped you.

00:40:56.910 --> 00:40:58.990
Are you athletes?

00:40:58.990 --> 00:40:59.510
No.

00:41:00.090 --> 00:41:04.910
We race, we run for miles, we do marathons, we make alms, but we keep our form with the ball.

00:41:04.910 --> 00:41:06.960
Who do you fight with?

00:41:06.960 --> 00:41:07.850
Between us.

00:41:07.850 --> 00:41:10.820
Oh yes, I remember an old saying.

00:41:10.820 --> 00:41:14.820
Twiddly-Dum and Twiddly-Dick fought like crazy.

00:41:14.820 --> 00:41:18.820
The two of them got mad because their hammer broke.

00:41:18.820 --> 00:41:21.030
I never had a hammer.

00:41:21.030 --> 00:41:23.920
The only thing that will break here is its head.

00:41:23.920 --> 00:41:25.920
I will break your head!

00:41:25.920 --> 00:41:26.920
Stop it!

00:41:26.920 --> 00:41:30.000
I'm sorry to mention this old saying.

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:32.500
It's time to go to the gym.

00:41:32.500 --> 00:41:34.500
You'll see where we go.

00:41:34.500 --> 00:41:37.180
Thank you, but I have to go.

00:41:37.180 --> 00:41:40.170
I have to reach the eighth square before nightfall.

00:41:40.170 --> 00:41:43.260
We'll run together and show you the way.

00:41:43.260 --> 00:41:45.320
I would love to.

00:41:45.320 --> 00:41:55.500
The door to square five is here.

00:41:55.500 --> 00:42:00.000
I can't see it because I'm taller than you.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:01.000
You're closer.

00:42:01.000 --> 00:42:02.000
No, higher.

00:42:02.000 --> 00:42:05.000
Well, then I'll get closer.

00:42:05.000 --> 00:42:08.790
Please, not again.

00:42:08.790 --> 00:42:10.960
We have to turn now.

00:42:10.960 --> 00:42:12.960
Thank you both for the help.

00:42:12.960 --> 00:42:16.910
Keep on walking and you'll soon reach the door of the fifth square.

00:42:16.910 --> 00:42:18.850
Go, run!

00:42:23.640 --> 00:42:30.000
Oh, it's very dangerous.

00:42:30.280 --> 00:42:37.440
There's a door to nothing that leads nowhere.

00:42:40.710 --> 00:42:46.680
It must be the entrance to square five, so I have to go through it.

00:42:50.750 --> 00:42:53.060
Go through! It's open!

00:42:57.020 --> 00:42:58.550
Bye! Whoever you are!

00:43:00.350 --> 00:43:04.610
- I'm Aliki. - Nice to meet you, Aliki. Come on in.

00:43:04.610 --> 00:43:12.800
- You? - Up here. Come on in. Come on in.

00:43:12.800 --> 00:43:19.620
- But... I think you're at least... - You called me Humpty Dumpty.

00:43:19.620 --> 00:43:24.470
Put the "H" and the "D" and two "D".

00:43:24.470 --> 00:43:30.000
I understood how you are. But I always imagined you different, you know.

00:43:30.380 --> 00:43:33.570
Yes, I think I am a bit different.

00:43:34.250 --> 00:43:38.550
Don't you constantly see eggs with hands and legs that talk and everything?

00:43:39.070 --> 00:43:45.170
Yes, but I thought you wore it as a shirt and pants, like a man-egg, do you understand?

00:43:46.170 --> 00:43:48.470
That's what you said, my little one.

00:43:48.770 --> 00:43:49.970
Man-egg.

00:43:50.200 --> 00:43:51.900
People don't make eggs.

00:43:52.320 --> 00:43:53.520
You're an egg-cat.

00:43:53.840 --> 00:43:55.340
Do you want to know what I am?

00:43:55.790 --> 00:43:57.690
Well, I'll tell you what I am.

00:43:58.080 --> 00:44:00.000
I am an egg-digger.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:03.170
And you can find these very rarely now.

00:44:03.170 --> 00:44:06.840
Oh! Egg Dinosaur!

00:44:06.840 --> 00:44:10.700
It takes a long time for an Egg Dinosaur to hatch.

00:44:10.700 --> 00:44:13.910
Geez! Too many years!

00:44:13.910 --> 00:44:19.990
I'm tired of waiting for my shell to break and so I started growing from the outside.

00:44:19.990 --> 00:44:24.020
And that's not very good. I can't live like this.

00:44:24.020 --> 00:44:26.160
But it's unbelievable!

00:44:26.160 --> 00:44:30.000
You don't believe it? I'll jump down to show you.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:32.810
Don't be a fool! You'll break it!

00:44:32.810 --> 00:44:39.100
Ohohohoho! An egg-shaped sword doesn't break so easily, my little one!

00:44:39.100 --> 00:44:40.500
What are you looking at?

00:44:40.500 --> 00:44:46.010
Forget that you've read a stupid book of fairy tales and believe me!

00:44:46.010 --> 00:44:53.440
I believe that if you had been stuck, you would have been huge and terrifying!

00:44:53.440 --> 00:44:56.750
You know, this would have been very funny.

00:44:56.750 --> 00:45:00.000
But I prefer to tell you what I would have liked to be.

00:45:08.640 --> 00:45:17.060
♪ I would like to be tall, but I'm a rotten stone. ♪

00:45:17.060 --> 00:45:21.670
♪ I'm not black, hard, hairy or ugly. ♪

00:45:21.670 --> 00:45:30.000
♪ There will be a reason to be able to make big fires. ♪

00:45:30.440 --> 00:45:34.440
Fretless, ungrateful whores!

00:45:34.740 --> 00:45:38.740
But what can I do? I can't, I'm not worthy!

00:45:39.040 --> 00:45:42.040
I will be left alone, an egg!

00:45:43.570 --> 00:45:47.060
I am what was written.

00:45:47.510 --> 00:45:51.510
Let me not grumble about it.

00:45:51.830 --> 00:45:56.190
Better to be what you can be.

00:45:56.390 --> 00:45:59.390
And just accept it.

00:46:00.960 --> 00:46:05.010
For you to go to the hills, you need to have wings

00:46:05.010 --> 00:46:09.740
They are not all there, they are nice and on the ground

00:46:17.270 --> 00:46:22.220
You don't want to be someone else

00:46:22.220 --> 00:46:26.240
Your good self is enough for you

00:46:26.240 --> 00:46:30.000
To think simply is all you need

00:46:30.250 --> 00:46:35.250
You've got so much that's enough

00:46:35.250 --> 00:46:38.940
Live as much as you can

00:46:38.940 --> 00:46:43.240
You'll see that you'll enjoy it

00:46:43.240 --> 00:46:47.670
And if you don't manage to climb high

00:46:47.670 --> 00:46:51.670
You'll be fine, you'll see it

00:46:51.670 --> 00:46:52.670
Come on!

00:46:52.670 --> 00:46:56.490
Live as much as you can

00:46:56.490 --> 00:47:00.000
You'll enjoy it

00:47:04.440 --> 00:47:17.560
You will see it, you will see it, you will see it.

00:47:19.450 --> 00:47:22.450
So, you can say that this is my philosophy.

00:47:24.010 --> 00:47:28.020
That's exactly what I said to Dom, when he told me that I have to be ugly to become a queen.

00:47:28.020 --> 00:47:30.000
I intend to stay as I am.

00:47:30.090 --> 00:47:31.600
That's exactly who I am.

00:47:31.600 --> 00:47:35.150
Then you will be very good, no matter who you are.

00:47:35.150 --> 00:47:39.450
Something is confusing me. I thought they would always sit on that wall.

00:47:39.450 --> 00:47:45.110
I'll tell you something, sitting on a wall is not the best thing in life.

00:47:45.110 --> 00:47:49.510
But the song says Hamdi Dabdi was standing on a wall.

00:47:49.510 --> 00:47:54.460
I guess now you have to change that little child song you're singing, don't you think?

00:47:54.460 --> 00:47:57.080
To make another song?

00:47:57.080 --> 00:47:59.000
Yes, something like that.

00:47:59.000 --> 00:48:00.000
Yes.

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:03.000
Will you stay here for a long time or are you just a passer-by?

00:48:03.000 --> 00:48:06.340
I'm going to the quadrangle 8 to become a queen.

00:48:06.340 --> 00:48:07.730
It's better if I leave.

00:48:07.730 --> 00:48:09.220
I will accompany you.

00:48:09.220 --> 00:48:11.670
I will show you the right direction.

00:48:20.950 --> 00:48:27.650
Do you want to see something that you will like a lot?

00:48:31.760 --> 00:48:36.290
It's like that big stone statue on the island of Pascha.

00:48:36.290 --> 00:48:46.760
My island of Easter eggs. I drew them all. It's my hobby.

00:48:46.760 --> 00:48:49.830
They're beautiful!

00:48:49.830 --> 00:48:55.770
Yes! Yes, my little ones, they're all Easter eggs. They're waiting to hatch.

00:48:55.770 --> 00:49:00.000
You drew this very beautifully. I hope it's a girl.

00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:04.140
You're wrong. I'm waiting for another boy.

00:49:04.140 --> 00:49:09.030
Strange. My dad told me exactly the same thing this morning.

00:49:09.030 --> 00:49:13.360
Tell your dad not to waste his time with egg dinosaurs.

00:49:13.360 --> 00:49:17.360
But no! You know, he was just talking about...

00:49:17.360 --> 00:49:21.360
The guy has no idea what "dinosaur" means, it seems.

00:49:21.360 --> 00:49:22.190
He's a doctor.

00:49:22.190 --> 00:49:28.100
So he cures sick dinosaurs? I've never been vaccinated.

00:49:28.100 --> 00:49:30.000
He's not that kind of doctor.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:31.920
You need to change your job.

00:49:31.920 --> 00:49:35.420
Aren't there many sick dinosaurs around?

00:49:35.420 --> 00:49:38.320
I'll tell him.

00:49:38.320 --> 00:49:40.320
I really like the Island of the Easter Eggs,

00:49:40.320 --> 00:49:42.210
but I have to go now.

00:49:42.210 --> 00:49:44.290
I'm sorry, but where are you going?

00:49:44.290 --> 00:49:47.290
Square 6 is on the other side of the island,

00:49:47.290 --> 00:49:50.310
just past the steep bridge.

00:49:50.310 --> 00:49:52.310
Thank you for showing me the way.

00:49:52.310 --> 00:49:54.230
I'm very glad I met you.

00:49:54.230 --> 00:49:56.700
I'm glad, too.

00:49:56.700 --> 00:49:59.040
You made my day.

00:49:59.040 --> 00:50:00.000
Come on, come on!

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:03.600
Now I have to go back to that heavy wall of mine.

00:50:03.600 --> 00:50:05.710
Good luck, my little one.

00:50:14.630 --> 00:50:17.610
My journey is getting more and more difficult.

00:50:17.610 --> 00:50:20.100
I wish Tom was with me.

00:51:11.640 --> 00:51:13.570
You're a killer!

00:51:13.570 --> 00:51:19.560
You're a killer!

00:51:31.630 --> 00:51:34.630
I will make a white suit for your orders, my dear guest!

00:51:34.630 --> 00:51:38.630
We will do rescues and other cruel acts for the whole 24 hours!

00:51:38.630 --> 00:51:41.630
As soon as you make the calls, we will be there!

00:51:41.630 --> 00:51:44.770
Thank you, sir! You are on time!

00:51:44.770 --> 00:51:49.890
This place is full of satanic creatures of all kinds!

00:51:49.890 --> 00:51:53.370
You shouldn't have gone in!

00:51:53.370 --> 00:51:55.370
I hope you didn't do it!

00:51:55.370 --> 00:51:57.370
But I have to go to square eight!

00:51:57.370 --> 00:51:59.420
I want to become queen!

00:52:00.960 --> 00:52:06.160
Queen! But then the subject changes, of course!

00:52:06.160 --> 00:52:10.860
It will be my honor to accompany you to pass through the kingdom of demons

00:52:10.860 --> 00:52:14.560
and to help you in every step, my lady.

00:52:14.560 --> 00:52:17.360
- Would you like that? - Oh yes!

00:52:17.360 --> 00:52:20.230
I will feel safer!

00:52:20.230 --> 00:52:24.750
Will you give me the magic wand to put it close to my heart?

00:52:24.750 --> 00:52:28.170
It is a simple habit that we have.

00:52:28.170 --> 00:52:30.000
Will you do that?

00:52:30.060 --> 00:52:31.960
I will be forever grateful to you

00:52:31.960 --> 00:52:33.960
I'm sorry, but I don't have a scarf

00:52:33.960 --> 00:52:36.250
But I have a paper scarf

00:52:36.250 --> 00:52:38.360
Ehm, leave it

00:52:38.360 --> 00:52:40.360
You don't get used to this

00:52:40.360 --> 00:52:44.190
Anyway, I will fight for you with the same courage

00:52:44.190 --> 00:52:46.390
Shall we go now?

00:52:46.390 --> 00:52:49.430
Should I sit in front of you or behind you?

00:52:49.430 --> 00:52:54.320
I'm afraid that Giselle can't carry two people, my dear

00:52:54.320 --> 00:52:56.820
I wouldn't want you to walk, though

00:52:56.820 --> 00:52:58.800
And I couldn't, either

00:52:58.800 --> 00:53:00.000
I can't make a living

00:53:00.030 --> 00:53:07.800
I'm done with this ship! It's heavy metal and these shoes are killing me!

00:53:07.800 --> 00:53:09.460
It's terrible!

00:53:09.460 --> 00:53:16.120
Yes, they fall a bit short and they don't help me at all! You understand, right?

00:53:16.120 --> 00:53:22.560
Yes! Don't worry at all! I'll walk! Of course!

00:53:22.560 --> 00:53:25.670
I'll go first!

00:53:33.420 --> 00:53:42.580
*Wild Cat Noises*

00:53:58.600 --> 00:54:00.000
I'll go ahead after you!

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:03.000
The seven creatures with the nails and the claws

00:54:03.000 --> 00:54:05.000
Go away, ridiculous creatures!

00:54:18.980 --> 00:54:20.990
Look! They're gone!

00:54:24.220 --> 00:54:27.230
Go back, ridiculous, terrible creatures!

00:54:27.230 --> 00:54:30.000
Or else you will feel the sword of the White Dwarf again!

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:32.880
Well, let's get out of here.

00:54:32.880 --> 00:54:37.850
I'm very sorry, but I have to go back to the castle right away.

00:54:37.850 --> 00:54:40.850
And I need a new crown.

00:54:40.850 --> 00:54:42.850
You need a crown.

00:54:42.850 --> 00:54:47.310
Oh, of course. I easily get injuries.

00:54:47.310 --> 00:54:51.190
But I'll be all alone in this terrible place.

00:54:51.190 --> 00:54:54.080
There are other white mushrooms around.

00:54:54.080 --> 00:54:57.090
Maybe you're lucky and you'll find one.

00:54:57.090 --> 00:55:00.000
I hope you're lucky. Really.

00:55:00.030 --> 00:55:13.210
- I hope so, but as I'm growing up, do you have the kindness to give me my sword, please?

00:55:13.210 --> 00:55:17.200
- Thank you very much, I needed it for balance.

00:55:17.200 --> 00:55:26.080
- Have a nice day, young man. May the good spirits protect you against my absence. God be with you.

00:55:26.080 --> 00:55:30.000
- I think I should be the one to protect him.

00:56:03.710 --> 00:56:05.640
I'm so glad you came back!

00:56:05.640 --> 00:56:08.020
Don't worry now!

00:56:08.020 --> 00:56:09.090
Let's go!

00:56:09.090 --> 00:56:17.720
There you are!

00:56:17.720 --> 00:56:22.690
As soon as we get into that tunnel, we'll be at square seven!

00:56:22.690 --> 00:56:24.770
I'm almost queen!

00:56:24.770 --> 00:56:27.850
It's the area of the Jumper Walk!

00:56:27.850 --> 00:56:29.720
Are you ready for that?

00:56:29.720 --> 00:56:30.000
Of course!

00:56:30.350 --> 00:56:33.350
I didn't come all the way here just to leave them now.

00:56:33.990 --> 00:56:35.490
Let's go then!

00:56:35.990 --> 00:56:52.600
The Jumper Walk is always full of some satanic servants.

00:56:52.600 --> 00:56:57.220
Let's hope he doesn't know we're here.

00:56:57.220 --> 00:57:00.000
Listen, my lady.

00:57:00.090 --> 00:57:03.930
I am the Jumperwog and I am bad!

00:57:03.930 --> 00:57:06.120
Waaaah!

00:57:06.120 --> 00:57:09.770
Don't get on my nerves, you morons!

00:57:09.770 --> 00:57:11.550
Don't scare the girl!

00:57:11.550 --> 00:57:14.480
I want you to stop her right now!

00:57:14.480 --> 00:57:16.880
You don't have to get to square eight!

00:57:16.880 --> 00:57:18.240
Do you hear me?

00:57:18.240 --> 00:57:20.040
Okay, it's done!

00:57:20.040 --> 00:57:22.960
Me and Bandersnatch will take care of everything!

00:57:22.960 --> 00:57:25.120
My lord!

00:57:31.630 --> 00:57:36.470
Yes! We are all partners! We will share them in three!

00:57:36.470 --> 00:57:46.000
If you underestimate me, because I am so small!

00:57:46.000 --> 00:57:52.770
I don't care how you will do it! Just stop it! It has come very close!

00:57:52.770 --> 00:57:54.750
I will step on it!

00:57:54.750 --> 00:57:59.380
I hope so! Otherwise, you will all step on it!

00:58:03.870 --> 00:58:07.570
For a little girl? Hahaha! It will be a little game!

00:58:07.570 --> 00:58:11.790
I can come and scream to scare her!

00:58:11.790 --> 00:58:14.510
You won't do anything! You're stupid!

00:58:14.510 --> 00:58:18.770
Everyone laughs when you try to do something wrong! You're a fool!

00:58:18.770 --> 00:58:22.120
No screaming!

00:58:22.120 --> 00:58:25.540
I made a mistake!

00:58:32.490 --> 00:58:34.490
we are the most terrible

00:58:34.490 --> 00:58:36.400
to fall, we are the worst

00:58:36.400 --> 00:58:38.480
BAD!

00:58:38.480 --> 00:58:40.820
BAD, BAD!

00:58:40.820 --> 00:58:42.780
we are the worst

00:58:42.780 --> 00:58:44.950
they run away for nothing

00:58:44.950 --> 00:58:48.240
BAD!

00:58:48.240 --> 00:58:50.990
I am Mandersnatch

00:58:50.990 --> 00:58:52.990
I put their fire in the fire

00:58:52.990 --> 00:58:54.990
Jumperwog

00:58:54.990 --> 00:58:56.990
the two together, BAD!

00:58:56.990 --> 00:58:59.440
I light up for a joke

00:59:00.090 --> 00:59:02.090
- This is my blanket. - No!

00:59:02.090 --> 00:59:03.650
- Bad!

00:59:03.650 --> 00:59:08.520
- When the job is done,

00:59:08.520 --> 00:59:10.840
- a new beginning with joy!

00:59:10.840 --> 00:59:11.940
- Bad!

00:59:11.940 --> 00:59:17.190
- I'm the Jumperwok,

00:59:17.190 --> 00:59:19.490
- don't think I'm soft!

00:59:19.490 --> 00:59:21.490
- And I'm a monster with spines!

00:59:21.490 --> 00:59:23.210
- Bad!

00:59:23.210 --> 00:59:25.710
- No one will find us on the road,

00:59:25.710 --> 00:59:27.920
- we scare them all on the way,

00:59:27.920 --> 00:59:30.000
- and he's unconscious in front of us,

00:59:30.220 --> 00:59:33.810
Who knows, in a minute, it will be lost!

01:00:03.740 --> 01:00:05.740
Hey, me too, Snuf!

01:00:05.740 --> 01:00:06.740
Who?

01:00:06.740 --> 01:00:07.650
I!

01:00:07.650 --> 01:00:09.990
Bad!

01:00:09.990 --> 01:00:19.000
So, what plan do we have?

01:00:19.000 --> 01:00:22.000
The Red Queen told you that the girl is smart.

01:00:22.000 --> 01:00:23.990
We are smarter!

01:00:23.990 --> 01:00:30.000
We are not going to let her pass this forest with nothing!

01:00:30.220 --> 01:00:39.830
Hahaha! We'll set a trap for her! So she'll fall straight on the crocodiles! Let's go!

01:00:39.830 --> 01:00:48.350
We made it halfway!

01:00:48.350 --> 01:00:50.270
And we didn't meet Jabberwock!

01:00:50.270 --> 01:00:52.270
Keep your eyes open!

01:01:06.460 --> 01:01:12.060
We blocked this side, and now, let's block the other side, ha-ha!

01:01:12.060 --> 01:01:15.890
The crocodiles will make a big mess!

01:01:15.890 --> 01:01:18.640
You can take the traps!

01:01:18.640 --> 01:01:22.770
Give me a second hand, man!

01:01:22.770 --> 01:01:25.950
Ha-ha-ha, here it is!

01:01:25.950 --> 01:01:30.000
It can't pass through any side, it has to pass through the...

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:35.980
And now, let's sit and wait for Glendy to come!

01:01:35.980 --> 01:01:49.100
The forest is on fire!

01:01:49.100 --> 01:01:51.100
No, it's the Bandersnatch!

01:01:51.100 --> 01:01:55.100
That means that the Jumper Walk is also somewhere near here!

01:01:55.100 --> 01:01:57.100
We can't avoid them!

01:01:57.100 --> 01:01:59.100
Don't come here! I'll go and see!

01:02:00.060 --> 01:02:01.670
Because it's too late.

01:02:01.670 --> 01:02:03.700
Don't worry.

01:02:03.700 --> 01:02:08.580
They set a trap to pass through the valley with the crocodiles.

01:02:08.580 --> 01:02:10.110
There is no other way.

01:02:10.110 --> 01:02:13.950
And the two sides are blocked with huge trees.

01:02:13.950 --> 01:02:15.390
Time for magic!

01:02:15.390 --> 01:02:16.130
Yes!

01:02:16.130 --> 01:02:18.530
Get ready for another little game.

01:02:18.530 --> 01:02:23.600
It was like something flying.

01:02:23.600 --> 01:02:24.850
What was it?

01:02:24.850 --> 01:02:26.400
I don't know.

01:02:26.400 --> 01:02:27.240
Huh?

01:02:27.240 --> 01:02:29.510
What was that sound?

01:02:30.380 --> 01:02:32.380
It sounded something like this...

01:02:32.380 --> 01:02:35.300
We did it!

01:02:35.300 --> 01:02:36.300
We are safe!

01:02:36.300 --> 01:02:38.260
Look over there!

01:02:38.260 --> 01:02:42.750
Is this the castle of the Red Queen?

01:02:42.750 --> 01:02:43.800
Yes!

01:02:43.800 --> 01:02:46.800
As soon as we cross the bridge we will be at the 8th!

01:02:46.800 --> 01:02:48.800
And the Queen will stab you!

01:02:50.590 --> 01:02:52.590
We won! We won!

01:02:55.990 --> 01:03:00.000
This stupid Jumperwock will pay for this!

01:03:01.120 --> 01:03:04.640
- I'm not standing here, Filan! Give me the office to the B!

01:03:04.640 --> 01:03:12.420
-

01:03:35.080 --> 01:03:40.720
Let us sleep with pleasure. The bridge is raised and the girls are locked outside.

01:03:40.720 --> 01:03:47.110
There will never be a queen!

01:03:47.110 --> 01:03:58.770
Will you marry me, Queen? Red Queen?

01:04:00.280 --> 01:04:02.680
What about the rules of the game, ma'am?

01:04:02.680 --> 01:04:05.310
It doesn't matter! Do something!

01:04:05.310 --> 01:04:07.450
It took a little time.

01:04:07.450 --> 01:04:10.760
I have to think of something very good to get rid of it.

01:04:10.760 --> 01:04:12.990
No matter how much you annoy me,

01:04:12.990 --> 01:04:15.640
I'll give it to you in blood!

01:04:15.640 --> 01:04:16.640
Oof!

01:04:16.640 --> 01:04:19.180
I'm king, really!

01:04:19.180 --> 01:04:25.310
Ah! Finally, I'm king!

01:04:25.310 --> 01:04:29.570
I promised to serve you, my lady!

01:04:33.320 --> 01:04:36.820
Start making your incredible magic right now!

01:04:37.240 --> 01:04:41.400
Come on! Make her throw the stick and disappear!

01:05:13.820 --> 01:05:16.280
I'm not that queen.

01:05:16.280 --> 01:05:20.150
Aha!

01:05:20.150 --> 01:05:24.150
Get the guards out of the castle and get me out of this madness! Drink more!

01:05:30.350 --> 01:05:32.460
Don't stand there!

01:05:32.460 --> 01:05:36.550
Take these two and lock them up in the prison of the tower!

01:05:36.550 --> 01:05:43.470
It's time to give him up!

01:05:43.470 --> 01:05:45.470
We can't leave like this!

01:05:45.470 --> 01:05:47.470
Use your magic rod to fly!

01:05:47.470 --> 01:05:49.610
Come on then!

01:06:15.680 --> 01:06:25.660
-What was that? -Wasn't that very magical?

01:06:25.710 --> 01:06:28.220
I don't have any more powers.

01:06:30.510 --> 01:06:33.310
- I lost my stomach. - Oh, it's okay.

01:06:33.310 --> 01:06:36.110
For me, you're still a queen.

01:06:36.110 --> 01:06:39.920
Thank you, Tom. You're very sweet.

01:06:39.920 --> 01:06:50.000
Aaaaargh!

01:06:50.000 --> 01:06:53.100
...and back up!

01:06:53.100 --> 01:06:56.990
- Do your magic! - I told you I lost them!

01:06:56.990 --> 01:07:00.000
But I have to go back to the mirror and find myself again

01:07:03.000 --> 01:07:06.400
You escaped from me for the first time, but not now!

01:07:25.440 --> 01:07:27.810
-We're on the other side! -Look!

01:07:30.410 --> 01:07:31.850
Follow me!

01:07:50.440 --> 01:07:53.290
Hello again and goodbye!

01:07:54.670 --> 01:07:57.590
It looks like they're having a pizza party around here.

01:07:57.650 --> 01:08:00.000
One, two, one, two, one, two, one, two!

01:08:00.060 --> 01:08:05.920
One, two, one, two, one, two, one, two, one, two. They have a marathon!

01:08:05.920 --> 01:08:07.760
They didn't tell us!

01:08:07.760 --> 01:08:14.630
Stop! We're not going that way!

01:08:31.690 --> 01:08:34.690
Vasily Saliki, let's have a cup of tea.

01:08:34.690 --> 01:08:39.410
You're not invited. You work for the Red Queen, you terrible monsters.

01:08:39.410 --> 01:08:41.410
Go away, go away!

01:08:42.410 --> 01:08:48.060
The tea is cold.

01:08:48.060 --> 01:08:50.810
Give it to me!

01:08:52.930 --> 01:08:58.050
Stay there!

01:09:00.060 --> 01:09:02.690
You better go! It's not far from here!

01:09:02.690 --> 01:09:04.700
You won't come with me?

01:09:04.700 --> 01:09:09.800
I have to stay here, to serve the White Queen, now that you're leaving.

01:09:09.800 --> 01:09:13.770
But how? After you lost your magic wand!

01:09:13.770 --> 01:09:16.550
Don't worry, I'll find another one!

01:09:16.550 --> 01:09:17.830
What's going on?

01:09:17.830 --> 01:09:20.030
I'll always remember you, Tom.

01:09:20.030 --> 01:09:23.430
And I'll never forget you, Queen Alice!

01:09:23.430 --> 01:09:29.440
I can't go to the mirror!

01:09:32.880 --> 01:09:36.960
I don't understand. Since you came this way, very easily.

01:09:36.960 --> 01:09:40.950
That's it! Everything here is upside down! Did you forget?

01:09:40.950 --> 01:09:43.050
You came in here, face to face!

01:09:43.050 --> 01:09:47.360
So, you have to leave with the Hoppisten!

01:09:47.360 --> 01:09:50.290
Adieu, Tom.

01:09:50.290 --> 01:09:52.530
Adieu, Aliki.

01:10:12.730 --> 01:10:18.600
- Who's Jumper? - I'm so glad to have you here.

01:10:20.910 --> 01:10:26.210
- Did you see Fialti? - No. He was wonderful.

01:10:26.720 --> 01:10:30.000
- I was a queen. - You'll always be a queen to me.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:32.240
my queen.

01:10:32.240 --> 01:10:34.510
That's what Dom said.

01:10:34.510 --> 01:10:36.610
Do I know this Dom?

01:10:36.610 --> 01:10:37.880
No.

01:10:37.880 --> 01:10:40.580
And Hamdi Dabdi said that...

01:10:40.580 --> 01:10:42.830
I know this guy.

01:10:44.170 --> 01:10:47.470
He said, "Don't waste your time with dinosaurs.

01:10:47.470 --> 01:10:49.570
Don't even try to cure them."

01:10:50.670 --> 01:10:53.600
My dear, if a dinosaur ever calls me,

01:10:53.600 --> 01:10:55.640
I will need a doctor.

01:10:55.640 --> 01:10:57.240
And now sit down and tell me

01:10:57.240 --> 01:10:59.440
this wonderful dream you saw.

01:11:02.300 --> 01:11:05.540
They began when I looked through the mirror.

01:11:07.240 --> 01:11:11.980
I wonder, was it really a dream?

01:11:30.090 --> 01:11:31.640
The actors were listened to.

01:11:32.030 --> 01:11:34.960
Giannis Stefopoulos, Lila Moutsopoulou,

01:11:35.450 --> 01:11:38.800
Haris Grigoropoulos, Argiris Pavlidis,

01:11:39.070 --> 01:11:42.460
Vasilis Toukis, Sofia Kapsambeli.

01:11:43.140 --> 01:11:45.490
Translation, Nicoleta Samoili.

01:11:46.490 --> 01:11:51.220
